  "definition": "In this packet, PDE refers to phosphodiesterase-5, an enzyme whose overactivity is described as a treatment target in erectile dysfunction. Drugs that inhibit PDE-5 are used for this purpose, and the article discusses efforts to find newer inhibitors with fewer adverse effects.",
